{"id":"edificio","lemma":"edificio","pos":"noun","rank":711,"glosses":["building"],"ipa":"/ediˈfiθjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"edificios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-edificio.wav","formAudio":{"edificios":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-edificios.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Qué es aquel edificio?","en":"What's that building?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453079"},{"text":"Los dos edificios se quemaron.","en":"Both buildings burned down.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551610"},{"text":"Este edificio nos pertenece.","en":"This building belongs to us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582669"},{"text":"Roma tiene muchos edificios antiguos.","en":"Rome has a lot of ancient buildings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589906"},{"text":"¿Cómo accediste al edificio?","en":"How did you get into the building?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540941"}]}